{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/jiJ6ERsulRMs1aE77dsAbg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:58.928301+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/jiJ6ERsulRMs1aE77dsAbg","html":"<div><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><p><span><span>为增进全国高校优秀大学生对上海交通大学护理学院办学特色、学科优势、研究生培养的了解，为促进学生之间的对话与交流，护理学院拟定于2025年7月9日-11日举办2026届全国优秀大学生夏令营活动（线下）。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ib3fN80vOndwYUOloq5ZusOf3dx4672ZkWVxPUic0yg0iaY0kJecMfUyHyibic1d3VsqMibAnQWMM6iaze9znjTSqKM2A/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><strong><span>夏令营</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/rEicmNL2IsehPWicJZXI1LXjrg8H5ST9EcRA9F2iclCajicAOKibibNm90zzAK6VHzN9x234HXjrhFyZb6tia3fiaWHMYQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><strong><p><span>一、学院与学科简介</span></p></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gj6q1k3UedD7HYA1jicFHjMOufHbVBM0ibwxMic3vT4UQYbDlhxF3iaNdU85ytibWBKLoIDzF51rROBkC4CKrUpvAtg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/WV0AbibzlYnGn6ibNiczG3Kd4cEWiaMKduP1DevjcpfTzsxApG39aY0MUib8xNmNqiaPQlR5P4qtPeZ0uMEIkjBrOwCA/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/06UDbO4VwsttHxkiamwqj7crRnE4fDXsCSmlOEOJicG2C1r098MjtnkyxsqCWnQ4ibdG08Paib0hZfEPtK6w0MjkuQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span><strong><span>1</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>．上海交通大学医学院简介</span></strong></span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/TlqeSLauHmicK5Lb1yE7bysBPf8mSEqzFnMfa0gYiakY1YL6cMrCBibcDpz9zf11HemggTmKyVg1m7DEWropCHQ8w/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>上海交通大学医学院是第一批十个重点高校之一，以“报效祖国、服务人民”为办学使命，秉持“博极医源、精勤不倦”的院训及“海纳百川、求真务实、守正创新、精诚奉献”的学院精神，现已发展成为一所享有较高国际声誉，师资力量雄厚，优势特色明显，学术成绩卓著，集医、教、研以及社会服务全面发展的研究型、创新型院校。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span><strong><span>2</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>．护理学院简介</span></strong></span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/TlqeSLauHmicK5Lb1yE7bysBPf8mSEqzFnMfa0gYiakY1YL6cMrCBibcDpz9zf11HemggTmKyVg1m7DEWropCHQ8w/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>上海交通大学护理学是全国首批护理本科院系，于2003年获批护理学硕士学位授权点，2011年成为全国首批护理学一级学科博士学位授权点，2023年获批护理学博士后科研流动站。学院现有专任教师78人，研究生导师41人，其中博士生导师10人、硕士生导师31人。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>学院学科底蕴深厚，拥有</span></span><span>25个国家级及中华护理学会教学实践基地、54个市级护理专科实训基地，上海市突发公共卫生预备队培训中心、医学院临床研究中心-护理分中心等平台。近五年累计承担各级各类科研项目120余项，获国家发明专利15项，专利转化合同金额达1000余万元，以第一作者或通讯作者共发表高水平学术论文近400篇。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span><strong><span>3.</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>研究生培养特色</span></strong></span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/TlqeSLauHmicK5Lb1yE7bysBPf8mSEqzFnMfa0gYiakY1YL6cMrCBibcDpz9zf11HemggTmKyVg1m7DEWropCHQ8w/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>秉持“海纳百川、求真务实、守正创新、精诚奉献”的学院精神，护理学院致力于培养具备国际视野，坚实宽厚的医学基础知识，系统把握精深的护理学专业知识及人文与社会科学知识，成为推动和引领护理学科发展、不断追求卓越的高层次护理创新人才。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>近年来，学院在国际合作领域取得显著进展，为研究生搭建了国际交流与科研合作的平台，以拓展学生的国际视野。与新加坡国立大学、英国伦敦国王学院、韩国延世大学等全球顶尖院校签署合作协议；开展“海外学者讲座”“国际青年学者论坛”“护理</span></span><span>+X论坛”“护新沙龙”“科研门诊”学术交流等品牌项目；设置专项基金，资助优秀研究生赴海外知名护理院校开展短期及中长期访学。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>学院</span></span><span>聚焦“母婴儿童护理学”“成人与老年护理学”“健康与慢病管理学”“交叉护理学”“急危重症与灾害护理学”等二级学科方向开展研究，</span><span><span>各二级学科方向介绍如下:</span></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>▶母婴与儿童护理学方向</span></strong><span>：聚焦孕产妇、新生儿以及儿童现存或潜在健康问题，包括急危重症孕产妇的救治保障、慢病儿童的家庭照护和全程管理，旨在推进“为广大妇女儿童提供全生命周期、全方位健康服务”的政策要求落地。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>▶成人与老年护理学方向</span></strong><span>：聚焦老年护理学、成人护理学、健康促进等领域，致力于探索全生命周期中成人与老年人的健康需求、疾病规律及其干预策略，以实现精准化、个性化的健康管理。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>▶健康与慢病管理学方向</span></strong><span>：聚焦国家战略规划中的“重大慢病防控”，拟以生活方式为突破口，开发科学、规范、可及性高的方案，明晰生活方式对重大慢病发生发展的影响及潜在机制。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>▶急危重症与灾难护理学</span></strong><span>：聚焦急危重症患者的抢救与护理、灾难救援中的护理实践及相关领域的科学研究与人才培养，旨在提升急危重症救治效率、优化灾难救援护理体系，推动护理学科在公共健康领域的专业化发展。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>▶交叉护理学方向</span></strong><span>：聚焦护理学科与基础医学、人工智能及材料学、精神心理学等交叉学科领域，探究全生命周期护理问题的组学机制及神经生物学基础，为构建个性化护理精准干预策略提供理论支撑。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gj6q1k3UedD7HYA1jicFHjMOufHbVBM0ibBVXomiaFTJibOtSjQTHdCZuCB0pESshn7dDqjNGUVqhBVhDkFoVGtHzg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ib3fN80vOndwYUOloq5ZusOf3dx4672ZkWVxPUic0yg0iaY0kJecMfUyHyibic1d3VsqMibAnQWMM6iaze9znjTSqKM2A/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><strong><span>夏令营</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/rEicmNL2IsehPWicJZXI1LXjrg8H5ST9EcRA9F2iclCajicAOKibibNm90zzAK6VHzN9x234HXjrhFyZb6tia3fiaWHMYQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><strong><p><strong><span>二、</span></strong><strong><span>申请资格</span></strong></p></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gj6q1k3UedD7HYA1jicFHjMOufHbVBM0ibwxMic3vT4UQYbDlhxF3iaNdU85ytibWBKLoIDzF51rROBkC4CKrUpvAtg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1、拥护中国共产党，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违法违纪受处分记录；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3、健康状况需符合教育部规定的研究生招考体检标准；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4、申请者为在校三年级本科生(2026年本科应届毕业生)，并对科研工作具有浓厚兴趣且有志从事学术研究或临床专科护理；学习成绩优秀，德智体美全面发展，</span><strong><span>本科阶段总成绩排名原则上在所在学校同年级本专业前</span></strong><strong><span>20%</span></strong><span>，在学术研究、竞赛获奖等方面有突出表现的可以适当放宽；</span></span></p><p><span><span></span><strong><span></span></strong><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>5、具有良好听、说、读、写的英语应用能力，英语水平须达到</span><strong><span>CET6≥425</span></strong><strong><span>或</span></strong><strong><span>TOEFL≥90</span></strong><strong><span>或</span></strong><strong><span>IELTS≥6.0</span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/EibjFaQNiaMbib7k5rJz5ojerJTGIfwvxWibCBoicVibRZ2yA1fpE3gdIqXkicOJLE2uicMiahqZWpe7ibbaRyicSvmoEnAjA/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gj6q1k3UedD7HYA1jicFHjMOufHbVBM0ibBVXomiaFTJibOtSjQTHdCZuCB0pESshn7dDqjNGUVqhBVhDkFoVGtHzg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ib3fN80vOndwYUOloq5ZusOf3dx4672ZkWVxPUic0yg0iaY0kJecMfUyHyibic1d3VsqMibAnQWMM6iaze9znjTSqKM2A/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><strong><span>夏令营</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/rEicmNL2IsehPWicJZXI1LXjrg8H5ST9EcRA9F2iclCaj