tion></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gj6q1k3UedD7HYA1jicFHjMOufHbVBM0ibBVXomiaFTJibOtSjQTHdCZuCB0pESshn7dDqjNGUVqhBVhDkFoVGtHzg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ib3fN80vOndwYUOloq5ZusOf3dx4672ZkWVxPUic0yg0iaY0kJecMfUyHyibic1d3VsqMibAnQWMM6iaze9znjTSqKM2A/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><strong><span>夏令营</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/rEicmNL2IsehPWicJZXI1LXjrg8H5ST9EcRA9F2iclCajicAOKibibNm90zzAK6VHzN9x234HXjrhFyZb6tia3fiaWHMYQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><strong><p><strong><span>五、</span></strong><strong><span>材料准备</span></strong></p></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>护理学院将根据学生报名信息，综合教育背景、学业水平、综合素质，确定入围名单。夏令营入围同学需全程参加夏令营各个环节。</span></span></p><p><span><span>所有夏令营入围同学报到时须按要求递交以下材料：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1、《上海交通大学护理学院2026年全国优秀大学生招生夏令营报名登记表》（报名系统生成）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、身份证扫描件、学生证扫描件（需包含封面、个人信息页、注册页）各1份；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3、本科期间成绩单扫描件1份（教务处盖章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4、截至目前，成绩在所学本科专业和年级的排名证明，以及已获绩点/绩点总分的证明（专业排名/排名总人数；年级排名/排名总人数；已获绩点/绩点总分）（教务处盖章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5、2位所在学院副教授及以上职称的专家推荐信（请使用报名系统中的模板）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6、其他证明材料扫描件（获奖或资格证书、国家英语四、六级等各类英语考试成绩单、论文著作等）各1份。</span></span></p><p><span><span>7、个人简历</span></span></p><p><span><span>注：夏令营入围同学请准备全套纸质版材料按入营邮件通知送至指定地点（具体另行通知）</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gj6q1k3UedD7HYA1jicFHjMOufHbVBM0ibBVXomiaFTJibOtSjQTHdCZuCB0pESshn7dDqjNGUVqhBVhDkFoVGtHzg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ib3fN80vOndwYUOloq5ZusOf3dx4672ZkWVxPUic0yg0iaY0kJecMfUyHyibic1d3VsqMibAnQWMM6iaze9znjTSqKM2A/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><strong><span>夏令营</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/rEicmNL2IsehPWicJZXI1LXjrg8H5ST9EcRA9F2iclCajicAOKibibNm90zzAK6VHzN9x234HXjrhFyZb6tia3fiaWHMYQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><strong><p><span>六、活动考核</span></p></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/TlqeSLauHmicK5Lb1yE7bysBPf8mSEqzFnMfa0gYiakY1YL6cMrCBibcDpz9zf11HemggTmKyVg1m7DEWropCHQ8w/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>护理学院将根据营员综合素质、科研能力和学术潜质等进行考核，考核评审结束后给予相应的考核等级（经医学院研究生院统一公示后生效），具体如下：</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>A</span></strong><strong><span>等，优秀营员</span></strong><span>，申请者须符合医学院接收优秀本科毕业生推荐免试攻读博士学位研究生招生要求，且与夏令营参加的培养单位及专业一致，将按照选拔结果择优录取，额满为止；</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>B</span></strong><strong><span>等，优秀营员</span></strong><span>，申请者须符合医学院接收优秀本科毕业生推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生招生要求，且与夏令营参加的培养单位及专业一致，将按照选拔结果择优录取，额满为止；</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>C</span></strong><strong><span>等</span></strong><span>，未获得夏令营优秀营员资格，仍可通过推荐免试或全国统考入学方式报考我校。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/GBeCEIeKzmA3wsmyFFTMBglTVickRs7fbg5389BsCXtmrW95x3cJ3iboCOOjuN1O50gvQGJTz39M9VIicJeG8bxWQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gj6q1k3UedD7HYA1jicFHjMOufHbVBM0ibBVXomiaFTJibOtSjQTHdCZuCB0pESshn7dDqjNGUVqhBVhDkFoVGtHzg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ib3fN80vOndwYUOloq5ZusOf3dx4672ZkWVxPUic0yg0iaY0kJecMfUyHyibic1d3VsqMibAnQWMM6iaze9znjTSqKM2A/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><strong><span>夏令营</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\